{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cQvNYDixF51795442415.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>阿根廷甲組足球聯賽次階段16強，河床3-1擊敗拉魯斯晉級。</p><p></p><p>紅白衫河床早段的罰球，奧達文迪門前失機，未能開紀錄。他之後在遠柱被踢中，球證判出12碼。艾美達15分鐘操刀射入，領先1-0。拉魯斯由卡里拉撞射得手，32分鐘追平1-1，是半場比數。</p><p></p><p>為河床開紀錄的艾美達，69分鐘罰球中門框，安查達補射入網。B組第四對A組第五，這支首階段亞軍以2-1再度超前。艾美達今場第二球89分鐘出現，河床贏3-1晉級，八強對科爾多瓦學院。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.384862+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:36:37.530047+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:26.239340+00:00","content_hash":"35bd03af273dab85fb888efe17df8263303042106dd4210b45ea3e35462aaa86","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.384862+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}